        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n    %% Actors\n    Cust([Customer])\n    Part([Partner])\n    Admin([Administrator])\n\n    %% Shared Authentication\n    Auth((Login / Register))\n\n    %% Customer Use Cases\n    Browse((Browse Trips))\n    Book((Book Reservation))\n    History((Check Trip History))\n    Review((Write Review))\n\n    %% Partner Use Cases\n    PartReg((Provide Info &amp; Await Validation))\n    Pub((Publish Trips))\n    ManV((Manage Vehicles))\n\n    %% Admin Use Cases\n    ManUsers((Manage Customers &amp; Partners))\n    ManCities((Manage Cities))\n\n    %% --- CONNECTIONS ---\n\n    %% Customer Actions\n    Cust --&gt; Browse\n    Cust --&gt; Book\n    Cust --&gt; History\n    \n    %% Partner Actions\n    Part --&gt; PartReg\n    Part --&gt; Pub\n    Part --&gt; ManV\n\n    %% Admin Actions\n    Admin --&gt; ManUsers\n    Admin --&gt; ManCities\n\n    %% --- INCLUDES (Mandatory Login) ---\n    Book -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n    History -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n    Pub -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n    ManV -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n    ManUsers -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n    ManCities -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; include &gt;&gt;| Auth\n\n    %% --- EXTENDS (Conditional Actions) ---\n    Review -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt; extend &gt;&gt;| History&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="xztmo56ufG3fdtTQVaop-52">
